Package: coal
Title: R Client for the Jev Classification API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person('Dan', 'Hicks', email = 'hicks.daniel.j@gmail.com', role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: A thin functional client for TypeSafe's Jev API, which evaluates a
    text state against typed questions and returns probabilities and confidence
    rather than generated text. Argument names mirror the HTTP fields. The main
    function is vectorized over states and returns a data frame with one row per
    state, so answers can be spliced onto a data frame inside a pipeline.
